  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_01",
      "hash64": "1F17C63F0FC03554",
      "text": "Tiens ? Ton visage me dit quelque chose...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_02",
      "hash64": "1F17C93F0FC03A6D",
      "text": "T’ai-je déjà vu[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e quelque part ?\\nHmmm, je ne m’en souviens plus...[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_select_01",
      "hash64": "D39DDF856D1796FE",
      "text": "Mon nom est [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_select_02",
      "hash64": "D39DDE856D17954B",
      "text": "Je m’appelle [VAR 0x0100(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_03",
      "hash64": "1F17C83F0FC038BA",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! Mais c’est bien sûr !\\nÇa me revient maintenant ![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_04",
      "hash64": "1F17C33F0FC0303B",
      "text": "Bon, nous avons assez perdu de temps.\\nAllons-y.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_01",
      "hash64": "2F8FD4C3B7EC7BAA",
      "text": "Monsieur Cyano !\\nUne petite minute ![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_05",
      "hash64": "1F17C23F0FC02E88",
      "text": "Clav ! Vieille branche, vous avez l’air en pleine\\nforme ! Mais que faites-vous ici ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_02",
      "hash64": "2F8FD3C3B7EC79F7",
      "text": "Voyons ! Je suis le proviseur de cette école, il est\\ntout à fait naturel que je me trouve ici.\\c\\nCela étant, pourriez-vous éviter de m’appeler\\nainsi devant les élèves... ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 172,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_03",
      "hash64": "2F8FD2C3B7EC7844",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, ne vous avais-je pas enjoint à me\\nretrouver dans mon bureau ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_06",
      "hash64": "1F17C53F0FC033A1",
      "text": "Ah bon ? J’ai dû oublier ce détail...[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_07",
      "hash64": "1F17C43F0FC031EE",
      "text": "Mais peu importe à présent, puisqu’[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0402)]ilelle est ici !\\nC’est l’élève en question, je présume ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0402"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_04",
      "hash64": "2F8FD1C3B7EC7691",
      "text": "Oui, effectivement, mais tout de même...[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_05",
      "hash64": "2F8FD0C3B7EC74DE",
      "text": "Ciel ! Pardonnez-moi, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].\\nJe me dois de faire les présentations.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_06",
      "hash64": "2F8FCFC3B7EC732B",
      "text": "Voici monsieur Cyano, le directeur de l’Institut\\nMyrtille où vous ferez votre échange scolaire.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_08",
      "hash64": "1F17BF3F0FC0296F",
      "text": "En effet, je suis le directeur de...\\nAttendez... ne vous l’avais-je pas dit ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_07",
      "hash64": "2F8FCEC3B7EC7178",
      "text": "À en juger d’après le visage de notre jeune ami[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e,\\nvous aviez vraisemblablement omis ce détail.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_08",
      "hash64": "2F8FCDC3B7EC6FC5",
      "text": "À propos, pourquoi avez-vous insisté pour\\nque m[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0B07)]onsieurademoiselle [VAR 0x0100(0000)] participe\\r\\nà un échange scolaire ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0B07"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_09",
      "hash64": "1F17BE3F0FC027BC",
      "text": "Vous êtes toujours aussi doué pour poser des\\nquestions pertinentes, mon cher Clav ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_10",
      "hash64": "1F14413F0FBD1D7E",
      "text": "Voyez-vous, je...\\nPour quelle raison était-ce, déjà... ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_11",
      "hash64": "1F14423F0FBD1F31",
      "text": "Attendez, ça me revient ! Septentria !\\c\\nTu y as rencontré une de nos élèves pendant\\nton voyage scolaire, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_12",
      "hash64": "1F143F3F0FBD1A18",
      "text": "Son nom est Roseille si je ne m’abuse. C’est elle\\nqui m’a parlé de toi et t’a recommandé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_13",
      "hash64": "1F14403F0FBD1BCB",
      "text": "Ah oui ! On m’a parlé d[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0505)]e lui’elle ! Mes sources m’ont\\nindiqué un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e élève particulièrement remarquable.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0505"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_14",
      "hash64": "1F14453F0FBD244A",
      "text": "J’ai aussi questionné les élèves de l’académie et\\nbeaucoup ont mentionné ton nom.[VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_15",
      "hash64": "1F14463F0FBD25FD",
      "text": "Et maintenant que je te vois en chair et en os,\\nje dois dire que tu piques ma curiosité ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_09",
      "hash64": "2F8FCCC3B7EC6E12",
      "text": "Vous aussi, vous avez entrevu son potentiel ?\\nJe suis ravi de l’entendre ![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headbb_16",
      "hash64": "1F14433F0FBD20E4",
      "text": "J’aimerais que tu viennes étudier dans mon école.\\nTa présence sera une vraie bouffée d’air frais ![VAR 0x0114(004B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_10",
      "hash64": "2F8C4FC3B7E963D4",
      "text": "On ne dirait pas comme ça, mais monsieur Cyano\\na l’œil pour déceler les talents.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_11",
      "hash64": "2F8C50C3B7E96587",
      "text": "Je vous encourage vivement à vous rendre à\\nl’Institut Myrtille afin d’approfondir votre\\r\\nconnaissance du monde, si le cœur vous en dit.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_12",
      "hash64": "2F8C51C3B7E9673A",
      "text": "Considérez cela comme le prolongement de\\nvotre Chasse au Trésor ![VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc02_0010_headteacher_13",
      "hash64": "2F8C52C3B7E968ED",
      "text": "J’aimerais vous accompagner, mais je pense que\\nnous pouvons faire confiance à monsieur Cyano\\r\\npour vous guider... Du moins je l’espère ?[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
